<title>USA: Ostex says C.R. Bard sues over patent.</title>
<headline>Ostex says C.R. Bard sues over patent.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ostex International Inc on Friday said C.R. Bard Inc has filed suit against Ostex in federal court, claiming patent infringement by Ostex's Osteomark product.</p>
<p>In a statement, Ostex said it believes the suit is without merit and Osteomark falls outside the claims of the C.R. Bard patent.</p>
<p>The suit was filed in U.S. District Court, Central District of California.</p>
